:bibcode:`2012A&amp;A...538A...8S`">Legal conditions applicable to (parts of) the data contained</INFO><INFO name="request_date" ucd="time.creation" value="2026-09-29T02:33:41Z"></INFO><INFO name="contact" ucd="meta.email" value="gavo@ari.uni-heidelberg.de">Contact option</INFO><INFO name="reference_url" ucd="meta.ref.url" value="http://dc.g-vo.org/califa/q3/sdl/info">More information on the data Source</INFO><INFO name="resource_version" ucd="meta.version" value="3">Version of a contributing resource.</INFO><INFO name="creator" ucd="meta.bib.author" value="Sánchez, F.">Name of a person or entity that produced a contributing resource</INFO><INFO name="creator" ucd="meta.bib.author" value="The CALIFA collaboration">Name of a person or entity that produced a contributing resource</INFO><INFO name="QUERY_STATUS" value="OK"></INFO><INFO name="standardID" value="ivo://ivoa.net/std/datalink#links-1.1">Written by DaCHS 2.12.2 DatalinkCore</INFO><INFO name="request" value="http://dc.g-vo.org/califa/q3/sdl/dlmeta?ID=ivo%3A%2F%2Forg.gavo.dc%2F~%3Fcalifa%2Fdatadr3%2FCOMB%2FNGC7684.COMB-21-01">Request string that produced this VOTable</INFO><TABLE name="dlresponse"><DESCRIPTION>Data links for data sets.</DESCRIPTION><FIELD ID="ID" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="ID" ucd="meta.id;meta.main"><DESCRIPTION>Publisher data set id; this is an identifier for the dataset in question and can be used to retrieve the data.</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="access_url" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="access_url" ucd="meta.ref.url"><DESCRIPTION>URL to retrieve the data or access the service.</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="service_def" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="service_def" ucd="meta.ref"><DESCRIPTION>Identifier for the type of service if accessURL refers to a service.</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="error_message" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="error_message" ucd="meta.code.error"><DESCRIPTION>If accessURL is empty, this column gives the reason why.</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="description" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="description" ucd="meta.note"><DESCRIPTION>More information on this link</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="semantics" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="semantics" ucd="meta.code"><DESCRIPTION>What kind of data is linked here? Standard identifiers here include science, calibration, preview, info, auxiliary</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="content_type" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="content_type" ucd="meta.code.mime"><DESCRIPTION>Media type for the data returned.</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="content_length" datatype="long" name="content_length" ucd="phys.size;meta.file" unit="byte"><DESCRIPTION>Size of the resource at access_url.</DESCRIPTION><VALUES null="-1"></VALUES></FIELD><FIELD ID="local_semantics" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="local_semantics" ucd="meta.id.assoc"><DESCRIPTION>An identifier that allows clients to associate rows from different datalink documents on the same service with each other.</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><FIELD ID="content_qualifier" arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="content_qualifier"><DESCRIPTION>An identifier for the sort of content obtained by dereferencing the link (e.g., spectrum, image, or cube). Terms here are relative to http://www.ivoa.net/rdf/product-type</DESCRIPTION></FIELD><DATA><TABLEDATA><TR><TD>ivo://org.gavo.dc/~?califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01</TD><TD>http://dc.g-vo.org/califa/q3/dl/dlmeta?ID=ivo%3A//org.gavo.dc/~%3Fcalifa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB.rscube.fits</TD><TD></TD><TD></TD><TD>Full data cube this spectrum was taken from</TD><TD>#progenitor</TD><TD>application/x-votable+xml;content=datalink</TD><TD>10000</TD><TD></TD><TD>#cube</TD></TR><TR><TD>ivo://org.gavo.dc/~?califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01</TD><TD>http://dc.g-vo.org/getproduct/califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01</TD><TD></TD><TD></TD><TD>The full dataset.</TD><TD>#this</TD><TD>application/x-votable+xml</TD><TD>-1</TD><TD></TD><TD>#spectrum</TD></TR><TR><TD>ivo://org.gavo.dc/~?califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01</TD><TD>http://dc.g-vo.org/getproduct/califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01?preview=True</TD><TD></TD><TD></TD><TD>A preview for the dataset.</TD><TD>#preview</TD><TD>image/png</TD><TD>-1</TD><TD></TD><TD></TD></TR><TR><TD>ivo://org.gavo.dc/~?califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01</TD><TD></TD><TD>proc_svc</TD><TD></TD><TD>
The Calar Alto Legacy Integral Field Area (CALIFA) survey provides
spatially resolved spectroscopic information for 667 galaxies, mainly
within the local universe (0.005 &lt; z &lt; 0.03).

CALIFA data was obtained using the PPAK integral field unit (IFU), with a
hexagonal field-of-view of 1.3 square arcmin, with a 100% covering factor
by adopting a three-pointing dithering scheme.  has been taken in two
setups: V500 (6 ? bin size, 646 galaxies) and V1200 (2.3 ? bin size, 484
galaxies).  A final product ("COMBO") combining both data sets, covering
3700-7500 ? at 6 ? bin size, is made availble for 484 galaxies.

CALIFA is a legacy survey, intended for the community.  This is the (final)
Data Release 3.  This is the VO/TAP publication with a simple web
interface on top.  See http://califa.caha.es/ for the upstream
site.</TD><TD>#proc</TD><TD></TD><TD>-1</TD><TD></TD><TD></TD></TR></TABLEDATA></DATA></TABLE></RESOURCE><RESOURCE ID="proc_svc" name="sdl" type="meta" utype="adhoc:service"><DESCRIPTION>
The Calar Alto Legacy Integral Field Area (CALIFA) survey provides
spatially resolved spectroscopic information for 667 galaxies, mainly
within the local universe (0.005 &lt; z &lt; 0.03).

CALIFA data was obtained using the PPAK integral field unit (IFU), with a
hexagonal field-of-view of 1.3 square arcmin, with a 100% covering factor
by adopting a three-pointing dithering scheme.  has been taken in two
setups: V500 (6 Å bin size, 646 galaxies) and V1200 (2.3 Å bin size, 484
galaxies).  A final product ("COMBO") combining both data sets, covering
3700-7500 Å at 6 Å bin size, is made availble for 484 galaxies.

CALIFA is a legacy survey, intended for the community.  This is the (final)
Data Release 3.  This is the VO/TAP publication with a simple web
interface on top.  See http://califa.caha.es/ for the upstream
site.</DESCRIPTION><INFO name="title" value="CALIFA Spectral Datalink Service"></INFO><GROUP name="inputParams"><PARAM arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="ID" ucd="meta.id;meta.main" value="ivo://org.gavo.dc/~?califa/datadr3/COMB/NGC7684.COMB-21-01"><DESCRIPTION>The publisher DID of the dataset of interest</DESCRIPTION></PARAM><PARAM arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="FLUXCALIB" ucd="phot.calib" utype="ssa:Char.FluxAxis.Calibration" value=""><DESCRIPTION>Recalibrate the spectrum.  Right now, the only recalibration supported is max(flux)=1 ('RELATIVE').</DESCRIPTION><VALUES><OPTION name="RELATIVE" value="RELATIVE"/><OPTION name="ABSOLUTE" value="ABSOLUTE"/></VALUES></PARAM><PARAM arraysize="2" datatype="double" name="BAND" ucd="em.wl" unit="m" value="" xtype="interval"><DESCRIPTION>Spectral cutout interval</DESCRIPTION><VALUES><MIN value="3.701e-07"></MIN><MAX value="7.501e-07"></MAX></VALUES></PARAM><PARAM arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="FORMAT" ucd="meta.code.mime" utype="ssa:Access.Format" value=""><DESCRIPTION>MIME type of the output format</DESCRIPTION><VALUES><OPTION name="VOTable, binary encoding" value="application/x-votable+xml"/><OPTION name="VOTable, tabledata encoding" value="application/x-votable+xml;serialization=tabledata"/><OPTION name="Tab separated values" value="text/plain"/><OPTION name="Comma separated values" value="text/csv"/><OPTION name="FITS binary table" value="application/fits"/><OPTION name="VOTable 1.6 beta" value="application/x-votable+xml;serialization=TABLEDATA;version=1.6"/></VALUES></PARAM></GROUP><PARAM arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="accessURL" ucd="meta.ref.url" value="http://dc.g-vo.org/califa/q3/sdl/dlget"/><PARAM arraysize="*" datatype="char" name="standardID" value="ivo://ivoa.net/std/soda#sync-1.0"/></RESOURCE></VOTABLE>